<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PHM" style="id">- Nchane</book>
  <para style="h">Filemu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ŋwa wù Bol gɛ̀ saŋ fɛ Filemu le</para>
  <para style="toc2">Filemu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Flm</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ŋwa wù Bol gɛ̀ saŋ fɛ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Filemu</para>
  <para style="mt2">le</para>
  <para style="imt">Fiɛɛ fì le a Ŋwa wu Filemu wunɛ le</para>
  <para style="ip">Filemu gɛ̀ bee muh wu Kletu, taŋlo wu nyume muh wu a kintaashɛ ki bamii ba mbɛmɛ ki Koloshiaŋ le. Wu gɛ̀ kɛme nfwa we ba tɛŋe lɛ Onisimu. Nfwa wuyu gɛ̀ ja wu legɛ wu gɛɛŋ wu bu fɛ Bol le fɛ yeh yi ncha le. Bol kusɛ Onisimu wu mo wu tu muh wu Kletu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋwa wunɛ, le Bol wu gɛ̀ saŋ fɛ Filemu le, ki wu lɛgɛ lɛ wu kâasɛ wu jô Onisimu wu lɛne wu le no wu gɛ̀ shee wu lɛne. Bol mo wu chiiŋsɛ Onisimu fɛ wu le wu lɛgɛ lɛ wu lɛ̂ɛshɛ fiɛɛ fì wu gɛ̀ ge, wu fî wa wu njɛ mwa bwee yi Kletu le.</para>
  <para style="iot">Bikwɛɛ bi mwɛɛ mù le a Ŋwa wunɛ le</para>
  <para style="io">1-3 Fɛŋkɛɛ</para>
  <para style="io">4-7 Bol bɛɛŋsɛ Filemu</para>
  <para style="io">8-22 Bol lɛgɛ lɛ Filemu fî Onisimu</para>
  <para style="io">23-25 N'yɛsɛ wù fɛkimɛsɛ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PHM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PHM 1:1"/>Le mɛ wù Bol, nle yeh yi ncha le nje nle muh wu Kletu Jiso. Le besa mwa bwee wese besabɛŋ wù Timoti. Nsaŋe ŋwa wunɛ fɛ wo le Filemu wù nsaa yese yi shɛ́ŋ wù besa bo lɛne yi fiɛɛ le fimimia. <verse eid="PHM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="PHM 1:2"/>Nsaŋe tɛ fɛ Afia wù jɛme yese besebɛŋ le, mo fɛ Alkibu wù besa bo juu yi fiɛɛ le fimimia njɛ bamii ba jɛŋ, mo fɛ kintaashɛ ki bamii ba mbɛmɛ kì taashi a wo yeh le. <verse eid="PHM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="PHM 1:3"/>Nyo wù Chiji wese besabɛŋ bɛ Tada Jiso Kletu dûnyɛ kiŋkoŋɛ fɛ bɛŋ le wu ka wu nyâ bɛŋ bɛ kimbonɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:3"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bol nya kiyone Nyo le nje Filemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PHM 1:4"/>Filemu, segechii mbuune ŋkwajɛ wo, nnyaa gɛh nyu kiyone Nyo waŋ le kune wo, <verse eid="PHM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="PHM 1:5"/>nje n'yuge no wo le wo leesɛ fitele yi Tada Jiso le, bɛ no wo koŋe bamii ba le ba Nyo bachii. <verse eid="PHM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PHM 1:6"/>Mbuune lɛ no wo le wo leesɛ fitele yi Jiso le, bena bamii ba Nyo nyu yi kintaashɛ le, finɛ lé fi gê wo mɛ̂sɛ wo kɛ̂ɛ mwɛɛ mù njoŋe munchii mù le mwesa besabɛŋ ba le yi kintaashɛ le bɛ Kletu. <verse eid="PHM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="PHM 1:7"/>Mwa bwɛɛŋ, kfuu chi kiŋkoŋɛ kì wo dunyi le ki ge n'yuge njoŋ baaŋ, fitele fiaŋ yufe nje wo gee muntele mu bamii ba Nyo jiɛɛ.<verse eid="PHM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Bol lɛgɛ Filemu kune Onisimu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PHM 1:8"/>Fiɛɛ fimi mo fi nyu yu fì ŋgoone lɛ wo gê, taŋlo ndu lo bɛ bvuŋga bvù ŋkɛme njɛ muh wu Kletu lɛ wo gê. <verse eid="PHM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="PHM 1:9"/>Geenɛ, nje kiŋkoŋɛ, ŋkude lo chiaaŋ wo le. Mɛ wù Bol nle wa ŋgamu, ŋka nyume yeh yi ncha le mɛɛse nje nle muh wu Kletu Jiso. <verse eid="PHM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PHM 1:10"/>Ŋkude chiaaŋ wo le kune mwa yaŋ wù Onisimu. Ŋgɛ̀ njo wu mwa yaŋ le yi mbɛmɛ le mɛ nyume yeh yi ncha le fɛnɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PHM 1:11"/>Fweele gɛ̀ bee wu nyume fiɛɛ fì achiji fɛ wo le. Mɛɛse wu le wa muh fɛ besa wo le bachii.<verse eid="PHM 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PHM 1:12"/>Nlé nchvûu wu jiŋ fɛ wo le mɛɛse, wu le fitele fiaŋ. <verse eid="PHM 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="PHM 1:13"/>Ŋkoŋe lɛ taŋlo ŋgɛɛ wu mbebe yaŋ le wu jiiŋe fɛ mɛne fɛ kijusɛ kuŋ le, no nle yeh yi ncha le fɛnɛ nje saaka wù joŋe kune Jiso. <verse eid="PHM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="PHM 1:14"/>Geenɛ, nle n'yɛŋ lɛ gɛ taŋlo ŋge fiɛɛ njɛ finɛ wo kee gɛ fo gɛ, nje gɛ ŋkoŋe lɛ lɛme chuŋ chì joŋe chì wo gee fɛ mɛne nyûme njɛ ŋkaane lo wo gɛ. Ŋkoŋe lɛ fi nyûme no fitele fiuŋ le fi bɛɛŋ.<verse eid="PHM 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PHM 1:15"/>Segemu Onisimu gɛ̀ ja a wo jii gɛh yi kife le nɛ shige, lɛ wu doo wu tu jiŋ, bena wu mo bɛŋ nyûme wa kimaga, <verse eid="PHM 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="PHM 1:16"/>wu ka nyûme gɛ nfwa gɛ, wu fêde wa nfwa. Wu le wa mwa bwoo wu shɛ́ŋ yi Kletu le, wu nyume tɛ muh wu shaŋ fɛ mɛne njɛ fɛ wo le, no wu le muh wu wuŋ wu ka nyume muh wu Tada. <verse eid="PHM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="PHM 1:17"/>Noo, nɛ wo fɛnɛ le wo yɛŋ lɛ besa wo le yi fiɛɛ le fimimia, wo fî wu no be bee tɛ mɛ wo fî. <verse eid="PHM 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="PHM 1:18"/>Nɛ le lɛ wu le wu jiaa fiɛɛ fɛ wo le, kɛnɛ lɛ, wu kɛme fioo bena wu, wo gɛ̂ɛ a jee chaŋ le. <verse eid="PHM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="PHM 1:19"/>Nsaŋe finɛ nyume bɛ kibo kaŋ lɛ, “Mɛ wù Bol nlé ŋgê nlâŋɛ.” Njɛme nɛ ŋkoŋe gɛ lɛ nshe nteede lo lɛ, wo tɛ kɛme fioo besa wo gɛ, nje kinche kì wo kɛme mɛɛse le nje mɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="PHM 1:20"/>Noo, mwa bwɛɛŋ, fî gɛh mɛ yi saaka wunɛ le nje besa wo le yi Tada le. Gêe noo nje kintaashɛ ki besa wo le yi Kletu le, ye joŋ mɛ. <verse eid="PHM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="PHM 1:21"/>Nsaŋe fɛ wo le nɛ, ŋkee chuule maŋe gɛ lɛ wo lé wo bɛ̂ɛŋ ki wo gê fiɛɛ fì njɛme, wo doo wo gee, wo ge wo fesɛ lo.<verse eid="PHM 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PHM 1:22"/>Ki ŋka ntaa fo, sêesɛ kijusɛ ki nche mɛne, nje njiiŋe fwe ŋkee lɛ Nyo lé wu yû buunɛ chena wu chîiŋsɛ mɛ fɛ bɛŋ le.<verse eid="PHM 1:22"/></para>
  <para style="s1">N'yɛsɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PHM 1:23"/>Ɛbafla wù besa wu le yeh yi ncha le fɛnɛ nje saaka wù joŋe kune Kletu Jiso, yɛɛse wo le. <verse eid="PHM 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="PHM 1:24"/>Maliku, Alistaku, Dɛma mo Luka ba besa bo lɛne yi kintaashɛ le, bo yɛɛse tɛ wo le. <verse eid="PHM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="PHM 1:25"/>Kiŋkoŋɛ ki Tada wese besabɛŋ wu Jiso Kletu nyûme fɛ biyo biɛna le. Fi nyûme noo.<verse eid="PHM 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="PHM 1"/>
</usx>
